  VERDICT: UNDERPOWERED -- NO VERDICT
  Fewer than two cuts can resolve the effect, so the design cannot
  deliver a majority and no claim about recurrence is made. Either
  accept cuts later in history only, or accept a smaller effect size
  as the thing being tested. Do not read the pooled tally as an answer.

  NO PASS/FAIL AND NO SKILL NUMBER. Climatology has nothing to be scored
  against but itself, and the screen in the first envelope run is a binary
  that cannot separate a 1pp gap from a 5pp one. This table is the output.

